00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:02.863
- I think gods in Buddhist fart.

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:09.090
- I'm Sara, and I am 10 years old.

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:11.100
- I'm four and I'm Tobie.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:14.000
- By law, I am Jewish, but I don't know

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.710
if I necessarily believe in it.

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:17.890
- I believe in Buddhism.

00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:19.920
- I believe in God.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:21.550
- For me, it's a really big maybe.

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:23.570
Part of me believes in God a lot,

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:26.030
and part of me definitely doesn't.

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:28.890
Because maybe there is someone upstairs,

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:30.400
making great things happen

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:32.240
and sprinkling magic on the world.

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:34.580
And then you see such bad stuff happen

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:36.863
and you see kids get cancer,

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:40.810
you doubt or you question God.

00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:44.490
- We have this thing called Guanyin,

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:49.330
it's kind of like God,
but it's like Chinese.

00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:51.970
- In my religion, we call him Allah.

00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:53.940
- He helps people.

00:00:53.940 --> 00:00:55.970
- God is love.

00:00:55.970 --> 00:00:59.900
- I think God has a sweet, soft voice.

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:02.150
- I think he would sound
like, "Hi" (laughs).

00:01:04.003 --> 00:01:05.440
- I think since he's lived so long,

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:08.387
it's kind of washed out, "I should make

00:01:08.387 --> 00:01:10.670
"good things happen to the world."

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:13.000
This sounds so creepy,
like a horror movie.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.090
- I think it sounds loud.

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:18.487
He sounds like really kind, I think.

00:01:18.487 --> 00:01:19.800
"Well hello" (laughs).

00:01:21.730 --> 00:01:24.957
- You can see him on the ground

00:01:24.957 --> 00:01:27.293
on his legs and on his feet.

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:30.610
- I think God is in the sky.

00:01:30.610 --> 00:01:35.030
- I pray to the Guanyin
to bring us good luck

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:36.400
and support my family.

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:38.560
- Usually what I wish for,

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:41.690
I'd like to spend time
with my mom all day.

00:01:41.690 --> 00:01:43.540
- I wanna have confidence in God,

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:46.250
if they control all of us,
I wanna have confidence

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:48.940
