and tell them to do it.

00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:51.570
I think they should
make great things happen

00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:54.660
and really prevent the
really bad, terrible things.

00:01:54.660 --> 00:01:58.013
- One time I went outside
and I prayed to God

00:01:58.013 --> 00:02:00.360
so I could have flowers.

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:02.790
- If there is a God, what is it?

00:02:02.790 --> 00:02:04.420
What do they look like?

00:02:04.420 --> 00:02:06.860
- God looks like a person.

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:08.569
- Maybe God's a woman

00:02:08.569 --> 00:02:12.590
or maybe God doesn't identify as a gender.

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:15.420
- They're usually gold or white.

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:18.280
- I think God will have green eyes.

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:21.290
