of him wearing a hoodie?

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:23.110
- I'm drawing him clothes,

00:02:23.110 --> 00:02:25.830
I don't really know if he has clothes

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:28.150
because I can't draw him naked.

00:02:28.150 --> 00:02:33.150
- He's wearing his masculine God t-shirt.

00:02:33.367 --> 00:02:36.080
Gotta put that God on there.

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:38.023
