00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:42.520
be able to see his hair, guys.

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:43.690
I don't think he has hair,

00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:46.450
I think it's hard to keep having hair

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:49.910
