00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:05.640
- His hands are very long and big.

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:07.823
- I now how to make hands, really.

00:03:09.635 --> 00:03:11.052
Like this circle,

00:03:12.245 --> 00:03:14.460
because my hands are circles, see?

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:17.463
- I don't think he looks
like anyone I know.

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:22.010
